meta {
  name: Retailers
}

docs {
  # Retailer APIs

  This folder contains API collections for each supported retailer.

  ## Supported Retailers

  - **Best Buy** - Products API for fetching product details by SKU/UPC

  ## Setup

  1. Copy `environments/local.bru` and add your API keys
  2. Select the environment in Bruno
  3. Run requests
}
